# What `docker build` sends to Docker. The Dockerfile copies only apps, packages and a few root files; this keeps
# everything else, and anything secret, off the build context. Patterns without **/ match at the root only.

# Secrets and the instance's own state, anywhere
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.data
deploy
instance.config.json

# Dependencies and build output
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Not part of the image
.git
.github
.reference
.claude
docs
apps/ios
apps/android
**/.DS_Store
